# Cohesive value-object families intentionally share their implementation file.
multiple-public-types | src/auto_reporter.rs | AutoReporter, Notifier, and Status form one scoped control protocol.
multiple-public-types | src/error.rs | The public error family exposes one coherent reporting contract.
multiple-public-types | src/event.rs | Phase and Event are one immutable wire model.
multiple-public-types | src/metric.rs | Metric configuration, counts, and snapshots are one metric model.
multiple-public-types | src/progress.rs | Builder, operation, and temporary snapshot form one lifecycle API.
